      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: \nThis is not same with Live as I have just tested it there and it didn't create this issue.\nPressing Join will bring you back to the world you were in with them before you left. Which creates three problems.\n1. \"Ask Me\" doesn't mean Ask Me anymore since you could just join them back (at least as long they haven't switched the world)\n2. You cannot join / invite request them if they switched world. The menu will still show the Join button and it will bring you to the old world.\n3. If you joined back to the world you were in with them, you cannot do anything with them. Can't invite them, and can't join them. \nSeems like those button still \"think\" they are in the same world as you. (Attached screenshot)",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
